samples 2801304, violations of |z-y|<rho: 0, max |z-y|-rho = -9.509e-08
=== (2) cover step, training side: |h(x_i)-g(x_i)| < rho+rho0+a ===
violations: 0, max |h-g|-(rho+rho0+a) = -2.565e-03
  sup of |h-g|/(rho+rho0+a) over samples = 0.999059 (tight -> 1)
=== (3) cover step, test side: |z-g|>tau and 2a<=tau-rho-rho0 imply |h-g|>rho+rho0+a ===
violations: 0 (boundary 2a = tau-rho-rho0 included: strictness of 2a<... is not needed)
=== (4) a = min{1/2,(tau-rho-rho0)/4}: 2a < gap and 1/a <= 4u' ===
2a<gap fails: 0;  1/a <= 4u' fails: 0;  max (1/a)/(4u') = 1.000000
=== (5) risk: (clip z - y)^2 <= min{4, (|z-g|+rho0)^2} ===
samples 2800269, violations: 0, max lhs-rhs = 5.551e-17
