=== (8) arithmetic of the example and of the admissible constants (sympy) ===
rho=2rho0, tau=4rho0: tau-(rho+rho0) = rho0 ; (tau+rho0)^2 = 25*rho0**2
u' at rho=2rho0,tau=4rho0: 1/min{1, tau-rho-rho0} = 1/min{1, rho0 }
inf over rho>rho0, tau>rho+rho0 of (tau+rho0)^2 = (3 rho0)^2 = 9*rho0**2 (not attained; u'->inf)
  stated constants 25: bound < 4 (non-trivial vs clipped range) iff rho0 < 2/5; bound < 1 (can beat L_D(0)<=1 at all) iff rho0 < 1/5
  best constants 9: bound < 4 (non-trivial vs clipped range) iff rho0 < 2/3; bound < 1 (can beat L_D(0)<=1 at all) iff rho0 < 1/3
fair signs: ess sup |y-g| = 1+|g| >= 1 => rho0>=1, tau>2, (tau+rho0)^2 > 9 > 4: vacuous. OK
